ness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T08:35:36-07:00","id":179734,"title":"","content":"A &quot;I believe I can fly &gt;:3&quot; character who also a sentinel magic garden, rainbow hair and wearing summer cloth in her human form, not to mention that gazebo in her portrait, Benetzet is stuffs that I like rolling into one package !<br /> <br /> Trying to make her hair look like rainbow colored oriental brush just fail miserably after the 14th tries so I just say screw that that slap Instagram filters on her hair until it don't look ugly anymore.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i1196.photobucket.com/albums/aa418/crimsonorigami/9f606b2799f41eb623b7f266f64661cb.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T11:04:30-07:00","id":181008,"title":"","content":"It's ok to post our own artwork, right? I recently redrew my character from my first campaign from yeaars ago to use as part of the description for the novel reward tier, and figured a picture was worth a thousand words.<br /> ..then I got worried about how long I should be taking and sorta rushed, so his tattoos are sorta derp and I couldn't think of clothes, so I just threw on a toga. &gt;.&gt;;; Mostly I like it, though.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.com/art/Jaxith-Dancing-463665487\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/643d9651-9c0e-4dd8-85b2-0fe850c5f2c0/d7o1ykv-23f9b41e-8544-4080-9f03-cbbfba050272.jpg/v1/fill/w_877,h_911,q_70,strp/jaxith_dancing_by_auroradragonkaya_d7o1ykv-pre.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..jIm8ctJD-Q4272TgmXfTnBo3li087PT_Ddy3iWrWdrU\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.com/art/Jaxith-Dancing-463665487\" target=\"_blank\"> Jaxith Dancing by auroradragonkaya on DeviantArt </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.com/art/Jaxith-Dancing-463665487\" target=\"_blank\"> http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.com/art/Jaxith-Dancing-463665487 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Jaxith Dancing &mdash; artwork by auroradragonkaya on DeviantArt. Published: 2014-06-26 &middot; Likes: 5 &middot; Views: 960 &middot; Comments: 1 </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I also sketched out some chibis from an exalted modern campaign with some friends a couple years ago.<br /> <a href=\"http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.com/art/Exalted-Modern-Chibis-159238939\" target=\"_blank\">http://auroradragonkaya.deviantart.c...ibis-159238939</a><br /> <br /> And I started doing a sketch version of the backstories of the characters, but I got distracted and stopped after two pages of sketches, so I'm not sure that's worth posting. &gt;.&gt; &lt;.&lt;;;<br /> <br /> I'm actually trying to get together enough of an exalted portfolio to try to do art for white wolf professionally (it's on my bucket list. Seriously, it is.) but I can't post anything I plan to enter in that portfolio online. :x","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2259-auroradragonkaya","name":"auroradragonkaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2259_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T08:25:46-07:00","id":182912,"title":"","content":"Instead of sketching on the look of my Circle, I have to doodle Mnemoe due to people keep flame baiting and stirring things up so here hoping that seeing Little Scarlet's tears will calm down their vitrolic heart.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i1196.photobucket.com/albums/aa418/crimsonorigami/40767b5923ad691c642d091229c94055.jpg?t=1403958820\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 06-28-2014, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T23:03:16-07:00","id":206782,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://s27.postimg.org/czzwjv6yb/strixness.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Both personae of my 3rd Edition Night Caste.<br /> Midnight-Blooming Jasmine is a rather slightly sheltered young woman from a wealthy family often dressed in the finest clothes and attending elegant galas where everyone in attendance wears a mask.<br /> She also has a very different mask and when she wears that she is someone else entirely. As Alabaster Strix she is no less a creature of ritual, silently hunting down those who disturb the night's peace in the name of her owl goddess mother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T03:32:02-07:00","id":206873,"title":"","content":"My 2e Night Caste and Scavenger Lord, Innocent Cerise Blossom, drawn by the ever awesome Andarix. Cerise originates from Nexus where her family are Scavenger Lords, their fortunes waxing and waning depending on what they find. She Exalted when her father disappeared and has gone in search of him in the East while managing the family business. She also gets upset when someone poaches one of her finds before she can get to it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[