png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Totally Baller","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T16:11:43-08:00","id":836727,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/h7TUwKv.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A little sketch I did recently of my character and our parties resident Dawn Beefmonster, Chikae, receiving a gift from an anonymous admirer. Because why fight eight feet and a quarter-ton of scars and muscle when you can win his affection instead? Fighting fair is for chumps. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11216-grindavikur","name":"Grindavikur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T21:43:42-07:00","id":848008,"title":"","content":"Had a random want to revisit a character who was my first Infernal concept back in 2009. A Slayer Caste known simply as the Lead Knight, who had kind of set herself up as a sort of Metatron to Hell and making a point to be the new Evening Star in the setting of the golden sun. Yadda yadda yadda. Main theme is cool armor, green fire effects with Vitrolic Corona Endowment spear and metal angel wings with green eyes on it to make it look creepy and arcangely.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/art/The-Lead-Knight-Revisited-596734522\" target=\"_blank\">The Lead Knight Revisited</a><br /> <br /> I did a bit of experimenting in jumping between Manga Studio 5 and Painter 2016 in a want to play with colors and try some visual effects. Picture has a bit of a mess in some areas, but still was fun overall. I might have had issues wiht Infernals in some areas of 2e, but I will not deny they had some fun aesthetics bits.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 04-19-2016, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T06:20:56-07:00","id":857090,"title":"","content":"Im new here so hopefully I'm doing things right.... I dont know how to do spoiler tags yet, so sorry it takes up so much space!!!<br /> <br /> Here is my main group's full circle of Solars ^^ It follows the same order as the book.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig04.deviantart.net/123f/f/2015/300/0/9/knights_of_the_sun_by_kurokuni-d9ek6es.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A different Night caste of mine, named Noya<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig09.deviantart.net/9b95/f/2016/035/3/3/noya_kun__oc__by_kurokuni-d