-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The main theme the player wanted was something where it stored souls and they could be used later for effects, more or less.</div> </div> </div> </div>So it's a Psypher?<br /> <br /> Graveryl, to be exact. Good choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T14:17:44-07:00","id":866114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=865906#post865906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not currently. The character first was designed to be honest based on the leak, and so his Evocations need quite a bit of reworking with the backer PDF. The main theme the player wanted was something where it stored souls and they could be used later for effects, more or less.<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The thought to me is what if every soul made a new link? It strikes me as the sort of thing that could be interesting both visually and give ideas on what it'd do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T14:27:39-07:00","id":866118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=866114#post866114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The thought to me is what if every soul made a new link? It strikes me as the sort of thing that could be interesting both visually and give ideas on what it'd do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll actually suggest that to him. He might like it. And it gives the thing a neat bit of aesthetic to add to it. I fully admit that the picture was fun for 1) I love drawing black hair. You get to just do something different with how it works compared to cliche straighter anime hair. 2) Figuring out how to use chain brushes in Clip Stuido. 3) Figuring out how to actually then make it not a nightmare to color and 4) Fun with touching with minimal gradients.<br /> <br /> My only wish is that I hadn't started the series with white backgrounds, as it does make this picture harder to see some of the details. \u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T14:34:06-07:00","id":866123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=866118#post866118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll actually suggest that to him. He might like it. And it gives the thing a neat bit of aesthetic to add to it. I fully admit that the picture was fun for 1) I love drawing black hair. You get to just do something different with how it works compared to cliche straighter anime hair. 2) Figuring out how to use chain brushes in Clip Stuido. 3) Figuring out how to actually then make it not a nightmare to color and 4) Fun with touching with minimal gradients.<br /> <br /> My only wish is that I hadn't started the series with white backgrounds, as it does make this picture harder to see some of the details. \u00a