l, figured I might as well share here. Hope you guys enjoy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11542-kurokuni","name":"kurokuni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T06:54:06-07:00","id":869284,"title":"","content":"I think something to think on in the future is kind of making some gits reflect a tad differently, even if they're the same color. The black parts of the sword handle look like holes or part of his outfit due to the fact that they're not just the same color but reflect light apparently in the same way. The red of the handle is a bit bright. In a dark scene like this it might have helped to make it a tad bluer or dimmer. Right now it looks almos tlike it's glowing like the Castemark there.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, quite like the picture overall. It's well composed and I like how you did the lighting otherwise overall.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T07:34:27-07:00","id":869305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=869066#post869066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd have to figure out Tumblr then. :P<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tumblr or something would be good! I want to get back into drawing Exalted stuff so I can finish up some art I owe people. A lively community would be nice in this regard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Pronounced &quot;Monkey Pie&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/762726-actual-play-the-party-prelude-project\" target=\"_blank\">Find my actual play content here!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/656-monkipi","name":"Monkipi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar656_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"318"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T10:55:35-07:00","id":869434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think something to think on in the future is kind of making some gits reflect a tad differently, even if they're the same color. The black parts of the sword handle look like holes or part of his outfit due to the fact that they're not just the same color but reflect light apparently in the same way. The red of the handle is a bit bright. In a dark scene like this it might have helped to make it a tad bluer or dimmer. Right now it looks almos tlike it's glowing like the Castemark there.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, quite like the picture overall. It's well composed and I like how you did the lighting otherwise overall.<br /> <br /> And stuff. </div> </div> </div>Thank you for the advice, I'll keep it in mind as I keep trying new things :O Although what I was meaning was more 'I feel like these colors dont flow together well for some reason' ... I think it has to do with the red and gold brighter/glowing bits clashing with the purpley blue cloak/hair/window scenery. Oh well. x-x<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://orig06.deviantart.net/265c/f/2016/111/b/2/lighting_play_by_kurokuni-d9zpxtm.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I've been redesigning Noya's (another night caste of mine) clothes some. Still cant figure out what I want... here it looks a little dynast like with the kimono esque flowy robes and dangly red thread detailing. Playing with lighting some more.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also I have a big folder of all my exalted artwork gathered, but I wasnt sure if there was any reasonable and convenient way to go about sharing it on here, without individually uploading each and every pic. (which would end up spammy anyways. =_=) Was wondering if anyone knew how to go about that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11542-kurokuni","user":"kurokuni","date":". 04-20-2016, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11542-kurokuni","name":"kurokuni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T21:49:54-07:00","id":870926,"title":"","content":"Playing around with digital art and getting back into drawing in general. Just flat colors. My Presence Supernal Eclipse courtesan Diaphanous Sundevil in my on-hiatus game.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'