ey":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T04:03:21-07:00","id":879428,"title":"","content":"Not really a commission since I did it myself, but close enough.<br /> Marjan, Dawn Caste. She is the daughter of the God of Sparring, and his priestess (not practicing much since her Exaltation, though). She's kinda cynical and jaded about religion and politics, and has come to the conclusion that if one wants things changed, you're just as well off punching/shooting the right people/things instead of trying to teach students who're not really motivated anyway.<br /> Soft spot for alcohol and her steed, a donkey (according to her, donkeys are much smarter than horses). She's very much about not trusting first impressions. Which is better, coming from someone whose appearance is more inspired by Sancho Pan\u00e7a than Hercules.<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/gkTVuHP.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> In the upper left corner, her Anima: a sunrise-coloured secretary bird (yet another critter with an utterly unimpressive name and appearance, but that straight up eats snakes for breakfast).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T06:14:05-07:00","id":879478,"title":"","content":"@kurokuni: the skull hair thingie amuses me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"li