k":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T05:35:45-07:00","id":939461,"title":"","content":"I've recently been practicing drawing my exalts again... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here's a group picture. From left to right is my Twilight (Kuro), the Dawn caste (Hikari) and their Day caste abyssal teacher (Forsaken Child of a Shattered Moon). They have a really strange group dynamic.<br /> <img src=\"http://orig07.deviantart.net/c731/f/2016/210/1/4/twilight_by_kurokuni-dabtruz.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Here's my Dusk caste (Lost one of Endless Sorrows). In this picture I was mostly practicing a new style, and experimenting with grungier, less saturated color palettes.<br /> <img src=\"http://orig13.deviantart.net/5023/f/2016/138/5/c/light_study_by_kurokuni-da2xquw.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11542-kurokuni","name":"kurokuni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T20:01:16-07:00","id":967692,"title":"","content":"I hope its ok to bump this thread back to the front, just wanted to share a commission I got from <a href=\"http://sobsofthegoblins.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">a friend of mine</a> earlier this summer, of my beleaguered soccer dad of a Dusk caste.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://67.media.tumblr.com/f98e96e4fac2fe99ba770ec85440b029/tumblr_o9ioghhkBw1uez9bzo1_1280.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>i don't know a hecking thing, my guy","edited":{"userid":4416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","user":"Heedra","date":". 09-11-2016, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","name":"Heedra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","v