=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Duanwu - night caste martial artist and assassin<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/vkaHbrn.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Horace - Zenith caste, former imperial soldier, turned mercenary<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/qMPpj4s.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T20:08:26-07:00","id":970438,"title":"","content":"And finally... Sans Serif - Dawn caste desert warrior<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/UCngLLr.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"