ent":"I especially like the third one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T03:37:04-08:00","id":1058342,"title":"","content":"This thread deserves some resurrection, I want to see more commissions. <br /> <br /> Here's one I did earlier.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/m61svW8.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <b>Neral, the Golem of Dunari, Dawn Caste</b></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T03:42:16-08:00","id":1058343,"title":"","content":"Why is she &quot;Golem of Dunari?&quot; Is her origin story similar to that of Wonder Woman's?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T03:49:09-08:00","id":1058348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1058343#post1058343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is she &quot;Golem of Dunari?&quot; Is her origin story similar to that of Wonder Woman's?</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd have to ask <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12735_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12735\" data-vbnamecard=\"12735\">BjornTheFellhanded</a>. I assume the title is not literal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T04:03:42-08:00","id":1058351,"title":"","content":"I don't know Wonder Woman's origin story very well, so I can't comment on that.<br /> <br /> The title is not truly literal, but borne out of rumours and claims that she's invulnerable. Between superheavy plate with a face concealing helmet, 5 Ox bodies and that 2E hearthstone Gem of Adamant skin, she jus never suffered worse than bruises. So eye witnesses to her fights would often end up denying that she could possibly be a living being and instead claim she was a suit of armour brought to life. A bard friend of hers then stoked those stories and it eventually stuck as a title.<br /> <br /> And thanks again, Crumblepunch! It's an awesome piece!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T05:58:40-08:00","id":1058374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1058351#post1058351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know Wonder Woman's origin story very well, so I can't comment on that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, the DC Universe has an island inhabited by the Amazons from Greek myth, obscured from the rest of the world. Their queen, Hippolyta, prayed for a daughter, and sculpted a figure out of clay, at which point Athena brought her to life.<br /> <br /> There's rather more to it than that, but that much at least sounds like something that could come out of the Exalted setting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> ______________<br /> *And before anyone says anything, <i>yes, I know</i> they later retconned it so she was <i>just</i> another of Zeus' bastards, making the prior story a lie of Hippolyta's, but frankly I don't particularly enjoy the change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-05-2017, 09:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T07:52:18-08:00","id":1058402,"title":"","content":"Few I've done in the last couple months (linking to my DA page since I don't really feel like embedding links):<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/art/Zulfaqir-the-Red-Sword-664502045\" target=\"_blank\">Zulfaqir, the Red Sword</a> - Dawn Caste from the game I run off and on over the summer. Chiaroscuran swordsman with well, red glass sword. Fun bit to me was layers of fabric.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/art/Cathay-Revisited-660274551\" target=\"_blank\">Cathay Red Dragon</a> - This is a redo of my first Exalted character from way back in 2002. She's gone through a few iterations but in 3e she's all about Artifact weapons and being a melee samurai I guess. Picture was mostly experimenting with lighting and things like the symmetry brush in Clip Studio Paint.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/art/Saturn-the-Maiden-of-Endings-666091315\" target=\"_blank\">Saturn, the Maiden of Endings</a> - My take on Saturn, based on designs I had before. Planning to do a full set of these and am currently working on Venus.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T08:58:23-08:00","id":1058433,"title":"","content":"Very cool, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a>! I love the attention to detail in the clothing, especially. That's still something I'm trying to get a hang of in my Exalted art!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T09:00:26-08:00","id":1058436,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2093_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2093\" data-vbnamecard=\"2093\">Crumplepunch</a>'s recent picture there I&quot;m actually pretty envious of. I like the details and general realism to the look of it personally. Also really good color choices with the lighter greens and warmer whites.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T09:20:41-08:00","id":1058442,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a> I'm trying to do somewhere between realistic and anime and it's such a hard balance to strike! I'd love to do something stylistically like the Avatar series, or the <a href=\"https://imagecomics.com/comics/series/monstress\" target=\"_blank\">Monstress</a><a href=\"https://imagecomics.com/comics/series/monstress\" target=\"_blank\"> comic</a>, or <a href=\"http://phobs.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Phob</a>'s amazing historic fantasy work. I just need to keep exploring till I find that style that I want for this stuff!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T10:20:45-08:00","id":1058462,"title":"","content":"I fully admit I do the anime/manga look because well, I think it's aesthetically appealing and I enjoy how flexible it is in its simplicty. It keeps the line and shading work pretty minimal about on its own. So then the simpler faces and body details can be used for things like dynamic poses, interesting props and so on. I felt this kind of showed in Saturn, where I think a lot of the detail is pretty much her clothing, sword and censer. It's a matter of for me for a while finding the right proportions in that art style though, like eye size, shape and all that. I think I only found one I felt pretty comfortalbe with in the last couple years there.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T16:22:58-07:00","id":1088539,"title":"","content":"Birthday present.<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Q6UkVxs.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" 