d by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1409538#post1409538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nice ! Is he themed &quot;Monkey king&quot; or does it have nothing to do with it ?</div> </div> </div> </div>He sure is!<br /> <br /> I made a homebrew Martial Arts style for Monkey Kung Fu, and he is a sorcerer with the Cirrus Skiff control spell - hence the 'Sage' part of his name. His staff is an artifact once wielded by a Solar called &quot;Victorious Fighting Sun&quot; and his teacher is a being called &quot;Great Heavenly Monkey&quot;, too.<br /> <br /> So, yeah, big Sun Wukong influences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5619-starkjunior","name":"StarkJunior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T07:16:01-07:00","id":1409554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StarkJunior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1409549#post1409549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He sure is!<br /> <br /> I made a homebrew Martial Arts style for Monkey Kung Fu, and he is a sorcerer with the Cirrus Skiff control spell - hence the 'Sage' part of his name. His staff is an artifact once wielded by a Solar called &quot;Victorious Fighting Sun&quot; and his teacher is a being called &quot;Great Heavenly Monkey&quot;, too.<br /> <br /> So, yeah, big Sun Wukong influences.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice I love it ! I'd really like to have the opportunity to play a character like this one day !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T19:35:39-07:00","id":1411039,"title":"","content":"I don't believe this was ever posted here. Stalking Cat, Chosen of Secrets. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radi