om/ojyXHyw.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> Art by<a href=\"https://robasarel.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Robasarel </a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":535,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","user":"Bastet","date":". 09-20-2020, 07:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","name":"Bastet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T18:27:35-07:00","id":1414849,"title":"","content":"Are the wings an artifact? Or is she a Person of the Air?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T05:36:26-07:00","id":1414902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1414849#post1414849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the wings an artifact? Or is she a Person of the Air?</div> </div> </div> </div>Person of the Air. The game is set in whats now the 2nd generation post usurpation and Gens Valaren were intended as an example of the excesses of the end of the first age. Previously proud and strong in their own right, they increasingly were shaped by the whims and aesthetics of their solar patron who liked the idea and forced the addition. The current members of the Gens have a somewhat complicated relationship with this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13512-andrix","name":"andrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-22T10:17:15-07:00","id":1415079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1414849#post1414849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the wings an artifact? Or is she a Person of the Air?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> The wings are an artifact but they are armour to protect her actual wings that she long ago realised were a powerful secondary pair of limbs that could really hurt if she hit you with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","name":"B